8. She plans to create more heartfelt, unscheduled content focused on supporting her audience. (Verbatim: "this is the most important content for me so i will be doing these more when these won't be on a schedule")

9. She values kindness and self-love, listing them as personal rules. (Verbatim: "rule zero be kind rule one love yourself")

10. She intends to have a larger, more planned debut event in the future. (Verbatim: "i'll make sure i plan something absolutely heckin spectacular for you all") [end of text]



1. Her mission as a VTuber is to bring happiness and "banana light" to people's lives. (Verbatim: "it is my mission to make you happy or you know you don't even have to aim for happy just to bring a little bit of banana light to to your life")

2. She identifies herself as a "celestial messenger" as part of her VTuber persona. (Verbatim: "i am a celestial messenger it is my mission to make you happy")

3. She planned to create a lore video for her channel but was unable to finish it in time. (Verbatim: "i wanted to prep a lore video i want to prep everything")

4. She made a poorly functioning game inspired by Jump King featuring a banana with banana physics. (Verbatim: "the idea was i wanted to make a game like jump king but instead of that i was thinking it could be like a banana jumping with banana physics")

5. She spent only two days developing the banana-themed game and considers it broken and unplayable. (Verbatim: "i spent like two days on this" / "it's broke it doesn't work")

6. She does not intend to monetize her game creations and believes no one should pay for them. (Verbatim: "i don't want to charge anything for them like um oh wait i never put the pinned message")

7. Her primary financial goal is to earn enough money just to eat, and she prioritizes her audience's well-being over her own. (Verbatim: "i really just want enough to eat that that's all and and anything extra would be like i'd i'd rather you look after yourselves")

8. She is an ambitious person who enjoys over-planning and preparing content for her audience. (Verbatim: "please forgive me i am an ambitious person yes and i like to be overly ambitious with with my to-do lists")

9. She wants to sing a cover of "Can't Help Falling in Love" and plans to do karaoke streams in the future. (Verbatim: "i wanted to sing can't help falling in love so i will probably release that as a cover instead but i'm definitely planning some karaoke soon")

10. She owns a Nintendo Switch and frequently plays Super Smash Bros., which makes her extremely nervous and sweaty. (Verbatim: "i have a switch i have a switch yeah yeah yeah although so the one game that gets me sweaty more than anything... it's smash") [end of text]



